{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫本年度《2026香港小姐競選》今日（2日）在電視城舉行首輪面試，有份獲邀參加首輪面試的參選佳麗於早上到電視城，準備下午見無綫高層進行面試。當中不乏打扮性感、身材出眾的高質靚女。</p><p>攝：葉志明、陳順禎、林迅景、陳釗</p><figure><img alt=\"黃薇。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413608099647488523647.jpeg/46T0hP9JQbNK8G0p9J69rDVFx7w7pl-Lau3Snmrt0p4\"/><figcaption>黃薇。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413620154339328631982.jpeg/h9x9TXBq6PQaBjKb4iKN6ZUHlRxGH2u_cr_ymXK_8pk\"/><figcaption>吳芍希 23歲 香港人 在紐約讀書 剛剛畢業 現從事金融工作。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138413617805398016810356.jpeg/RDj6QAP3QQolj5EaNVF5sZcKT1M0z5_IzQERe80BEXs\"/><figcaption>吳芍希貌似薛凱琪。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415285427113984045783.jpeg/4k7VgTQAmw1YeCKf0MYwh2XnFHpUXTnhOkEShzpBEoc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415144955547648152094.jpeg/_IP6Zxdw6JLi-CUgGZlsE_o3DTL2zzQFad9WR2nfVkc\"/><figure><img alt=\"Cecilia。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138415581318352896960174.jpeg/6UY0XvuVG3k5l4FSru3AaPx3waJkcKz-LCggOiwoIDo\"/><figcaption>Cecilia。</figcaption></figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138416844634329088907132.jpeg/R-m4YTA9g4SD47RTcTFSWH_Xd0UVHcsi8Prxt_D68bc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138419238646583296204369.jpeg/9ms02uPwL9SQSXsBBKvfyZ9CMiJf7gmlOrhaUzq4WlM\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138419470499319808723610.jpeg/73mBYyN8CCZQP8GkYLp1FnCJGLhehDsill5uQpZebkI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138419676645167104450879.jpeg/df1pQi3Iv9qhPVjvdkI82ZxMBBqzRnBUW3fqwFt36sA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138420356617342976895241.jpeg/Ban2d20GLgDx7i9wVTTR5MAx4kd95Cze_qKb4f6im-E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260602/1138419740327284736083954.jpeg/UixAe4TBCDzll2C0q0dEv7STbGo8shksksVsYZLFbGE\"/></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T02:18:57.734739+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":162,"images":12,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}